g"},{"surface":"தெறிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"தெறிக்கும்","lemma":"தெறித்தல்","gloss":"to splatter"}],"gloss":"splattering"},{"surface":"ஆன்","parts":[{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஆன்","gloss":"cow"}],"gloss":"cow"},{"surface":"மேல்","parts":[{"text":"மேல்","lemma":"மேல்","gloss":"upon"}],"gloss":"upon"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புடை","parts":[{"text":"புடை","lemma":"புடை","gloss":"side"}],"gloss":"side"},{"surface":"இலங்கு","parts":[{"text":"இலங்கு","lemma":"இலங்கு","gloss":"shine"}],"gloss":"shining"},{"surface":"ஒள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒள்","lemma":"ஒள்","gloss":"bright"}],"gloss":"bright"},{"surface":"வாள்","parts":[{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"வாள்","gloss":"sword"}],"gloss":"sword"},{"surface":"புனைகழல்","parts":[{"text":"புனை","lemma":"புனை","gloss":"adorn"},{"text":"கழல்","lemma":"கழல்","gloss":"warrior's anklet"}],"gloss":"adorned warrior's anklet"},{"surface":"ஓயே","parts":[{"text":"ஓய்","lemma":"ஓய்","gloss":"you"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"vocative"}],"gloss":"oh you"}]}],"literal":"Without returning even as the great herd with bulls is retrieved, / hiding their presence in the leaf-covered great forest, / look at the crouching of the strong-bowed warriors! / Do not go, do not go! May your resolve excel, / like a washerwoman with a bent back, / upon the cows that leap and splatter, / oh you with a bright sword shining at your side and adorned warrior's anklets!","translation":"Even as the great herd of cattle led by bulls is being retrieved, they do not retreat. Instead, they hide themselves in the dense, leaf-covered forest. Behold the stealthy crouching of those strong-bowed warriors! Do not advance, do not advance! May your courage rise, oh warrior with a bright sword shining at your side and adorned anklets, as you stand upon the cows that leap and splatter like a bent-backed washerwoman!","modern":"காளைகளையுடைய பெரிய ஆநிரைகள் மீட்கப்பட்டுத் திரும்பியபோதும் பின்வாங்காமல், இலைகள் அடர்ந்த பெரிய காட்டில் தம் உடலை மறைத்துக் கொண்டு காத்திருக்கும் வலிமையான வில்லையுடைய வீரர்களின் பதுங்குதலைப் பார்! செல்லாதே, செல்லாதே! உன்னுடைய நெஞ்சம் சிறப்பதாக! முதுகு வளைந்த வண்ணாரப் பெண் துணிகளைத் துவைக்கும்போது நீர் தெறிப்பது போல, துள்ளித் குதித்துச் செல்லும் பசுக்களின் மேல் ஏறி, பக்கவாட்டில் விளங்கும் ஒளிரும் வாளையும் காலில் புனைந்த வீரக்கழலையும் உடையவனே!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Karantai (cattle-recovery) theme, where the poet Kōdai Pāṭiya Perumpūtaṉār addresses a brave warrior. The poet warns him that the enemy raiders have not retreated even though the cattle herd has been retrieved. Instead, they are lying in ambush, crouching stealthily in the dense, leaf-covered forest. The poet urges the warrior to halt and praises his courage. The poem features a vivid rustic simile comparing the cows leaping and splattering mud to a bent-backed washerwoman vigorously beating clothes on a stone, causing water to splatter.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.76],[1.76,2.1],[2.1,2.99],[2.99,3.5],[3.5,3.5],[3.5,4.8],[4.8,5.7],[5.7,5.9],[5.9,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,7.5],[7.5,7.5],[7.5,8.3],[8.3,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.86,9.22],[9.22,10.3],[10.3,10.63],[10.63,10.77],[10.77,10.77],[10.77,12.0],[12.14,13.2],[13.2,13.3],[13.5,14.2],[14.2,14.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.87],[1.87,2.3],[2.3,2.3],[2.3,4.1],[4.1,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,6.1],[6.1,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,7.0],[7.0,8.2],[8.2,8.3],[8.3,9.0],[9.0,9.1],[9.1,9.2],[9.56,9.92],[9.92,11.0],[11.0,11.51],[11.51,11.86],[12.2,12.7],[12.7,13.2],[13.4,14.4],[14.4,14.8],[14.8,15.18],[15.18,15.7]]},"sync":[[["ஏறு","bull"],["உடை","possessing"]],[["பெரு","great"],["நிரை","herd"]],[["பெயர்தர","to be retrieved"],["பெயராது","without retreating"]],[["பெயராது","without retreating"]],[["இலை","leaf"],["புதை","hiding"]],[["பெருங்காட்டு","of the great forest"],["தலைகரந்து","hiding their presence"]],[["தலைகரந்து","hiding their presence"]],[["இருந்த","who were"]],[["வல்","strong"],["வில்","bow"]],[["மறவர்","warriors"]],[["ஒடுக்கம்","crouching"]],[["காணாய்","behold"]],[["செல